icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:01cf040a-d86f-4138-95c1-17a19b33808d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:01cf040a-d86f-4138-95c1-17a19b33808d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In a <a href=\"/wiki/Rosewood_Desk\" title=\"Rosewood Desk\">Rosewood Desk</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Szarr_Palace#Guest_Room\" title=\"Szarr Palace\">Szarr Palace Guest Room</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1288&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;962</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Dalyria's Private Diary \n</p><p><br> \n</p><p>Before I was Dalyria, vampire spawn slave to <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cazador\">Cazador Szarr</a>, I was Doctor Dalyria, Physician General to the Parliament of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a>.\n</p><p><br> \n</p><p>Spawn or no, I'm still Doctor Dalyria, and I will not submit to this lowly status.\n</p><p><br> \n</p><p>The others say vampirism is a curse, but in my educated opinion, it's a disease, and therefore must be vulnerable to medical treatment.\n</p><p><br> \n</p><p>I believe a massive infusion of fresh, youthful blood may overwhelm the vampirism infection and enable my body to heal. There is one potential source of such blood here: <a href=\"/wiki/Victoria\" title=\"Victoria\">Victoria</a>, the as-yet pureblooded daughter of <a href=\"/wiki/Leon\" title=\"Leon\">Leon Onufrio</a>.\n</p><p><br> \n</p><p>Leon was a <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">sorcerer</a> before he was a <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Spawn\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vampire Spawn\">vampiric slave</a>, and has warned us not to prey upon Victoria as he has imbued her with a counter-curse in the event of attack - made her a necrotic booby-trap, as it were.\n</p><p><br> \n</p><p>I think Leon is bluffing.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Vampire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vampire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Vampire\">Vampire</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202005\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1800/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34421/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10315/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nE